        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A direct currency purchase; no quest chain or random drop is needed.\n\n1. Travel to the Broken Isles version of Dalaran, map 627. Use an available Dalaran teleport/transport and confirm you are not in the Northrend city, which has different vendors.\n\n2. Enter the Magical Menagerie around 58.7,39.3 and speak to Draemus. Check that you have 50 SHINY Pet Charms; the newer Polished charms are a different currency.\n\n3. Buy River Calf for 50 Shiny Pet Charms and use the item to learn it. There is no Draenor reputation or wild-capture requirement for this vendor route.\n\n4. If you prefer to keep the charms, buy a cage of this exact species from the Auction House. River Calf, Sea Calf and Albino River Calf have different sources and are not interchangeable.",
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-14",
        tips = "",
