        sourceAchievementId = 9643,
        description = "An account-wide milestone for collecting six hundred unique pet species across all expansions.",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "A broad six-hundred-species collection takes sustained collecting, although individual pets can be easy.",
        requirements = "600 different collectible pet species",
        cost = "Varies with your chosen collection route",
        commentIDs = { 2013605 },
        areaMaps = { 84, 85 },
        npcId = 87705,
        petNPCID = 87705,
        name = "Stormwing",
        warlordsPetGuide = true,
        sourceType = "Achievements",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - A broad six-hundred-species collection takes sustained collecting, although individual pets can be easy.\n\n1. Track So. Many. Pets. (9643) and check its unique-species count. Three copies or different breeds of the same species count as ONE species. There is no requirement that the pets be rare quality or level 25.\n\n2. Collect missing city-vendor and common wild species first, then work through regional Safari checklists. Use the addon's Uncollected filter to avoid spending money on a species already in your account journal.\n\n3. Fill gaps with affordable caged drops/crafts, quest rewards and available event vendors. Compare prices and only learn a cage whose level your account can accept. There is no need to buy retired promotions or a particular old Collector's Edition to reach six hundred in Retail.\n\n4. When the achievement reaches 600 unique species, collect the Stormwing reward from achievement mail and use its item. This cross-expansion collection milestone belongs under General rather than requiring a particular Draenor map destination.",
