        npcId = 88830,
        petNPCID = 88830,
        name = "Trunks",
        warlordsPetGuide = true,
        sourceType = "Achievements",
        stepCount = 8,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Forty-four two-fighter victories include rotating Tournament trainers and time-limited Faire battles.\n\n1. Obtain Elekk Plushie from a tailor or a cage and keep it in one team slot for EVERY criterion battle. Track achievement 9069. Build a range of level-25 damage, avoidance and healing pets because two fighters must beat each enemy team.\n\n2. Prepare counters before each tamer: use strong damage against the enemy families and avoid large telegraphed attacks with Dodge, Burrow, Decoy or Deflection. A durable Anubisath Idol, Mechanical Pandaren Dragonling, fast rabbit, snails and hard-hitting family counters are useful tools; no single two-pet lineup reliably covers all forty-four.\n\n3. Clear Lydia Accoste in Deadwind Pass, Stone Cold Trixxy in Winterspring, then the five Outland masters: Nicki Tinytech, Ras'an, Narrok, Morulu the Elder and Bloodknight Antari. Use the individual trainer pins; Outland and Draenor Nagrand/Shadowmoon are different maps.\n\n4. Complete Northrend's Beegle Blastfuse, Okrut Dragonwaste, Gutretch, Nearly Headless Jacob and Major Payne. Continue with Brok, Bordin Steadyfist, Goz Banefury and Obalis. If Obalis is missing, ask Zidormi for the earlier Uldum phase; the current assault phase is not his normal location.\n\n5. Complete the seven Pandaria masters Hyuna, Nishi, Mo'ruk, Yon, Zusshi, Shu and Aki, plus all four Pandaren Spirits. Use the earlier Vale phase for Aki when needed. Treat the Spirit battles as separate fights; the Plushie must remain in the team for each win.\n\n6. Complete Draenor's Ashlei, Cymre, Gargra, Taralune, Tarr and Vesharr. Use strong Magic attacks for the Flying teams, Mechanical damage for Gargra's Beasts and Undead attacks for Tarr's Humanoids; adjust the two fighters for Cymre's mixed team. Heal between outdoor battles.\n\n7. At Master Li on Timeless Isle, enter the Celestial Tournament with at least fifteen level-25 pets. Across its three weekly rotations beat Cho/Goldbloom/Sully, Taran Zhu/Chen/Wrathion and Wise Mari/Blingtron/Kiryn with the Plushie present. You cannot use normal out-of-battle healing inside; bring separate teams or leave and restart as needed for trainer credit.\n\n8. During an active Darkmoon Faire, use Game Tokens to fight Jeremy Feasel and Christoph VonFeasel with the Plushie in the team. These are the final two of the forty-four criteria, not an optional substitute for the Tournament. Confirm every criterion, then collect and learn Trunks from achievement mail.",
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-14",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/npc=88830",
    },
