        sourceType = "Dungeon and Raids",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - The raid is simple on a high-level character, but a weekly random pet drop can require repeated clears.\n\n1. Use a high-level character with bag space, or compare Grotesque cages on the Auction House. Farming this companion does not require a battle-pet team. The cage also counts toward Raiding with Leashes III after learning.\n\n2. Enter the Caverns of Time in Tanaris, then take the Hyjal Summit portal inside. Speak to Jaina to begin the Alliance camp's waves, clear Rage Winterchill and Anetheron, then use Thrall's Horde camp waves for Kaz'rogal and Azgalor. Speak to the camp leader again when the next event needs starting.\n\n3. Continue through both camps' waves to the Horde camp's second boss, Azgalor. Loot him before leaving the event area.\n\n4. Learn the Grotesque reward if it drops. Otherwise return after this character's weekly raid reset, try an eligible alt, or buy a cage. Leaving and resetting the same saved raid does not create a new boss-loot attempt.",
