        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - The raid is simple on a high-level character, but a weekly random pet drop can require repeated clears.\n\n1. Use a high-level character with bag space, or compare Wretched Servant cages on the Auction House. Farming this companion does not require a battle-pet team. The cage also counts toward Raiding with Leashes III after learning.\n\n2. Travel to Isle of Quel'Danas and enter Sunwell Plateau. Clear the raid in order. Kalecgos must be completed correctly if he blocks progress; enter the spectral realm and defeat the demon while the dragon encounter is active. Do not skip the trash before the Eredar Twins, since it can keep them from appearing.\n\n3. Kill Lady Sacrolash and Grand Warlock Alythess, then loot the encounter for Servant's Bell. Clear the preceding trash if their room is empty; do not skip straight through the Sanguine Chamber.\n\n4. Learn the Wretched Servant reward if it drops. Otherwise return after this character's weekly raid reset, try an eligible alt, or buy a cage. Leaving and resetting the same saved raid does not create a new boss-loot attempt.",
