        name = "Nethaera's Light",
        warlordsPetGuide = true,
        sourceType = "Other",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A short search and emote interaction; no battle, currency or quest chain.\n\n1. Travel to the Dalaran floating above Crystalsong Forest in NORTHREND, map 125. Do not use the Broken Isles Dalaran pet-vendor route. Make a simple /target Nethaera macro and search the city while pressing it.\n\n2. Check the documented candle positions around the profession shops, wine shop, banks, flower stall and Krasus' Landing stairs. The candle moves between possible positions; no target can mean it is waiting to respawn. Its nameplate can float far above its actual position on the ground.\n\n3. After targeting it, mark the target if useful, dismount and stand next to the VISIBLE candle. Confirm it is the friendly world NPC, not another player's companion with an owner's name. Use /cheer, wait for its brightening/fireworks, and cheer again if needed.\n\n4. Wait for the pet-added notification and check the journal. It learns directly rather than creating an item in your bags. Cheering from far above the nameplate can miss the reward; if it disappears without credit, locate the next spawn and stand beside it before cheering.",
