        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - The old encounter is accessible, but the pet is random and raid loot is limited by weekly lockouts.\n\n1. Travel to Icecrown Citadel at the recorded entrance. Set raid difficulty to Heroic before entering; Raid Finder is not the farming route.\n\n2. Complete the three upper wings and use the central teleporter to reach the Frozen Throne. Confirm the instance is actually HEROIC before killing the Lich King. If the difficulty did not change after a different raid, leave and select Heroic outside; the menu selection alone can be misleading.\n\n3. Loot the Lich King's corpse or encounter chest and look for the pet item. Use it to learn Wicked Soul; killing the boss alone does not teach the pet.\n\n4. If the pet does not drop, repeat on another eligible character or after the weekly reset. Follow the instance's lockout rather than repeatedly resetting a cleared raid. A caged Wicked Soul from another player is an alternative.",
