        name = "Tylarr Gronnden",
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-16",
        legionPetGuide = true,
        sourceType = "Vendor",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Win the early solo Brawler fights and reach rank three before purchasing.\n\n1. Use a level-80-or-higher character for the current Brawler introduction. Alliance: enter the Deeprun Tram from Stormwind's Dwarven District at 66.5,34.8 and find Pick Butterworth by the platform. Horde: find Alton Philips beside the Brawl'gar Arena entrance at 70.1,31.5 in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor.\n\n2. Complete By Invitation Only? and, for a new account, Questionable Qualifications: pay 50 gold for Blood-Soaked Invitation and use it. Previously invited accounts can proceed to The Gloves Are Off. Go downstairs to Bizmo's Brawlpub or enter Brawl'gar Arena, then speak to a Bouncer / Grunt to start ranked fights. Farming an old Legion invitation drop is unnecessary.\n\n3. Win the four rank-one fights: Sunny, Doomflipper, Goredome and Dippy. Then win rank two: Bruce, Bill the Janitor, Oso and The Quacken. Speak to the queue NPC again after each victory. Choose RANKED fights; random challenges do not advance the rank needed for the pet. Interrupt dangerous casts and move out of marked attacks, preserving offensive cooldowns for the encounter timer.\n\n4. Speak to Quackenbush in Bizmo's Brawlpub or Paul North in Brawl'gar Arena. Buy Tylarr Gronnden for 500 gold when the rank-three requirement is met, then learn it. The pet cannot be caged, so check your collection before buying.",
        tips = "",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/npc=119040",
    },
