        legionPetGuide = true,
        sourceType = "Pet Battle Dungeons",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - A full multi-stage level-25 pet dungeon without between-battle healing in challenge mode.\n\n1. Bring a healed bench of level-25 battle pets, including Mechanical attacks for beasts, Flying attacks for aquatic enemies, and a durable Aquatic pet for the final elemental spore. Start A Call from the Caverns at the Magical Menagerie in Legion Dalaran if you have not unlocked pet dungeons.\n\n2. Meet Muyani above the Wailing Caverns entrance in Northern Barrens, around 38.8,68.2. Climb into the left eye-socket of the large skull above the ordinary cave entrance; she is not at the character-dungeon portal. Complete Wailing Critters first; this introductory version allows healing between battles.\n\n3. Accept Muyani's weekly Pet Battle Challenge: Wailing Caverns and enter the challenge version. Pet healing, revival and bandages are disabled between battles, so keep spare counters and avoid spending your entire strongest team on the opening snakes.\n\n4. Complete every stage, including the final Budding Everliving Spore. A documented final-boss counter is a P/P Emperor Crab using Surge, Renewing Mists and Shell Shield: keep Shell Shield up, heal with Renewing Mists and use Surge between renewals. The capturable pet is a reward item, not the dungeon boss itself.\n\n5. Turn in the weekly challenge for Damp Pet Supplies and open the bag. Learn Everliving Spore if it drops. The bag can contain one of three pets or other supplies; repeat on a future weekly reset, or buy a caged copy. Repeating only the normal introduction does not award another weekly bag.",
