        sourceType = "Pet Battle Dungeons",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - A full pet dungeon with no between-battle healing in challenge mode, followed by weekly currency collection.\n\n1. Complete Wailing Critters, the Wailing Caverns introductory pet dungeon. Pick up Deadmines, Part Two from the Legion Dalaran pet-dungeon contacts; this prerequisite is required even if you can solo the ordinary character dungeon.\n\n2. Find Marcus 'Bagman' Brown beside the barn / meeting-stone area in Moonbrook, Westfall, at 41.45,71.4. Ask him to enter the PET BATTLE scenario. Running through the ordinary Deadmines dungeon portal is not the reward route.\n\n3. Complete the normal Deadmines pet-battle introduction, then accept the weekly challenge from Marcus. Prepare a healed level-25 bench with Mechanical attacks against monkeys / beasts, Magic attacks against parrots / flying enemies, Flying attacks against aquatic crabs, and Elemental attacks against mechanical enemies. Challenge mode disables healing and revival between battles.\n\n4. Defeat every stage through the final boss and leave through the scenario's exit. Do not abandon the run after an early boss: the weekly reward requires the complete challenge.\n\n5. Turn in the challenge for one Old Bottle Cap. Save 3 caps across eligible weekly completions, then buy Pocket Cannon from Marcus and learn it. These vendor pets cannot be caged, so an Auction House cage cannot bypass this purchase.",
