        petNPCID = 124858,
        name = "Bronze Proto-Whelp",
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-16",
        legionPetGuide = true,
        sourceType = "Scenario",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Unlock and repeat the scenario, then choose wallet rewards from Sands of Time.\n\n1. Meet Chromie on top of Wyrmrest Temple in Dragonblight, around 59.9,54.6. Complete her introductory future-attack quests to unlock The Deaths of Chromie scenario.\n\n2. Enter the scenario and clear enemies / objectives around the dragonshrines to collect Sands of Time. Spend the scenario's earned talent progress to improve later attempts; you do not need a perfect eight-shrine timed clear just to obtain wallets.\n\n3. Open Sands of Time and choose Time-Lost Wallet when offered. Open the wallets for a random chance at Bronze Proto-Whelp; Bronze Proto-Whelp and Ageless Bronze Drake are separate possible pets.\n\n4. Learn the pet if found. Repeat the scenario for more Sands and wallets if needed, or obtain a caged copy from another player. Leaving and starting another attempt does not guarantee a different pet.",
        tips = "",
