    [382] = {
        category = "Secrets",
        source = "Oddly-Colored Egg - Cavern of Consumption",
        itemId = 142223,
        difficulty = "hard",
        description = "A consumable-and-transformation puzzle in the hidden cave north of Winterspring.",
        difficultyReason = "Numerous exact consumables, long potion cooldowns and a strict cave sequence.",
        commentUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=142223",
        commentIDs = { 2501299, 2501505 },
        areaMaps = { 242, 243 },
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 388, x = 0.218, y = 0.462, step = 3, label = "Scotty - Scotty's Lucky Coin" },
            { mapID = 69, x = 0.625, y = 0.249, step = 3, label = "Dire Maul North - Knot Thimblejack inside" },
            { mapID = 71, x = 0.518, y = 0.287, step = 3, label = "Gadgetzan - Noggenfogger vendor" },
            { mapID = 83, x = 0.25, y = 0.48, step = 3, label = "Winterfall furbolgs - Firewater farm" },
            { mapID = 627, x = 0.585, y = 0.395, step = 3, label = "Magical Menagerie - Little Princess costume" },
            { mapID = 83, x = 0.48700000000000004, y = 0.002, step = 4, label = "Winterspring - fly north beyond map edge" },
            { mapID = 12, x = 0.5720000000000001, y = 0.159, step = 4, label = "Cavern of Consumption - north coast" },
        },
        npcId = 61087,
        petNPCID = 61087,
        name = "Sun Darter Hatchling",
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-16",
        legionPetGuide = true,
        sourceType = "Secrets",
        stepCount = 11,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Numerous exact consumables, long potion cooldowns and a strict cave sequence.\n\n1. Prepare six MAJOR Protection Potions: Fire, Frost, Arcane, Nature, Shadow and Holy. Greater / Lesser versions do not substitute. Also obtain plenty of Noggenfogger Elixir, Scotty's Lucky Coin, Dire Brew, and a rank-ONE Scroll of Intellect. Bring spare consumables in case you are teleported out.\n\n2. Choose a sign route before travelling. Ogre route: bring Ethereal Oil, Gordok Ogre Suit and Winterfall Firewater. Pug route: bring 20 or more Pygmy Oils, know the Perky Pug companion, and bring a 'Little Princess' Costume for it. Replies confirm either sign route can open the final gate; the original guide did both.\n\n3. Collect missing special items: kill Scotty in Townlong Steppes at 21.8,46.2 for his Lucky Coin. In Blackrock Depths' Grim Guzzler, talk repeatedly to the Dark Iron Brewer upstairs by the stove until he passes out, then loot his tankard for Dire Brew; do not kill him. In Dire Maul North, take Gordok Ogre Tannin from the small basket above Knot Thimblejack's room and exchange it with him for the suit, or buy a traded suit. Buy Noggenfogger in Gadgetzan; Winterfall Firewater comes from furbolgs around 25,48 in Winterspring. The Pug comes from Looking For Multitudes, while its costume costs one Shiny Pet Charm at a pet-supply vendor. Compare a caged Sun Darter before buying puzzle supplies.\n\n4. Fly due north from Winterspring around 48.7,0.2 to the coast beyond the zone edge. Find the Cavern of Consumption using the Kalimdor overview destination at 57.2,15.9. The coast / cave is outside the ordinary Winterspring map: 57.2,15.9 is NOT a Winterspring pin.\n\n5. INSIDE the cave, drink Major Fire Protection to cross the fire barrier. Drink the remaining five Major Protection Potions, waiting for each shared five-minute cooldown. Their cave buffs last roughly an hour; do not drink them all outside where normal short durations can expire. Keep all six buffs active to pass the fel barrier. If Frost has only a short duration, use it last.\n\n6. Drink Noggenfogger until you have the SKELETON transformation, then pass the gargoyle barrier. At the right-hand vines, use Scotty's Lucky Coin to become a forest sprite. Click the Water Stone inside without stepping into the pool, use the stone, return to the fork and pass the blue water barrier.\n\n7. Drink Dire Brew immediately after passing the water barrier, before approaching the Stone Watcher. Continue to the two sign branches. Follow step 8 for the Ogre route OR step 9 for the Pug route; both are documented below so you can use the supplies you prepared.\n\n8. Ogre route: use Ethereal Oil to cross the right purple barrier and follow the ramp to the Strange Stone. Use Gordok Ogre Suit and Winterfall Firewater together, then interact with the stone and place your arm in the hole to gain Sign of the Second. Walk back down the ramp, hugging the wall; do not jump off an edge.\n\n9. Pug route: follow the left branch and drink Pygmy Oil repeatedly until the buff changes to the Pygmy transformation, not merely a smaller character. Pass the small opening, summon Perky Pug, use the 'Little Princess' Costume on it and interact with the Wisdom Cube to gain Sign of the First. Return carefully down the ramp.\n\n10. Pass the final gate once your chosen sign route opens it. At the Tarnished Plaque, cancel Winterfall Firewater if you used the Ogre route, then use Scroll of Intellect I. Higher-rank intellect scrolls are not the same puzzle item.\n\n11. Read the plaque and WALK down the sloping path on its right to the egg pool. Avoid jumping down, touching unintended water or cutting across a ledge: these can teleport you back to the entrance. Loot the Oddly-Colored Egg and use Sun Darter Hatchling. If the egg was just looted by someone else, allow it to respawn; each participant needs their own loot.",
        tips = "",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/npc=61087",
        references = {
            "https://www.wowhead.com/npc=61087",
            "https://www.wowhead.com/item=142223",
            "https://www.wowhead.com/item=142223#comments:id=2501299",
            "https://www.wowhead.com/item=142223#comments:id=2501505",
        },
    },
