        ["Rotten Little Helper"] = {
            acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A short seasonal combat-and-rescue daily with a random bag reward.\n\n1. During Winter Veil, Alliance characters visit Wulmort Jinglepocket in Ironforge 33.2,67.8; Horde characters visit Kaymard Copperpinch in Orgrimmar 52.4,77.0. Accept You're a Mean One... and any required first-time Metzen breadcrumb offered there.\n\n2. Travel to the Growless Cave in Hillsbrad Foothills around 43.5,39.0. Defeat the Abominable Greench, rescue Metzen the Reindeer and recover the Stolen Treats from the camp. Complete every objective, not just the boss kill.\n\n3. Return to the capital's holiday quest giver and claim the full Stolen Present (item 116762 in the current reward table; old comments refer to 93626). Open it for a chance at Rotten Little Helper. The lower-level Stolen Gift (149503) is a different bag without this pet; check that you qualify for the full present before doing the daily. Ordinary tree presents are a separate source.\n\n4. Repeat the available daily on later days/eligible characters during Winter Veil, or buy the pet as a cage. Use the pet item if awarded; its reindeer riding animation does not mean a separate mount must be obtained.",
