        ["Gusting Grimoire"] = {
            acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - The cage has no gameplay gate, but supply and the player-set price can be restrictive.\n\n1. Search the Auction House's battle-pet cages for Gusting Grimoire, species 1174. Inspect the cage's species and required learning level before buying; a similar floating book is not the same collectible.\n\n2. Buy the correctly named cage and use it to add the pet. This is the direct in-game route and requires no physical card or quest chain.\n\n3. If you already own a genuine unused Betrayal of the Guardian loot card instead, redeem it through Blizzard's current TCG redemption process for your account region/realm. Take the resulting in-game code to Landro Longshot in Booty Bay at 42.6,71.5 and select the matching loot reward.\n\n4. Use the received Gusting Grimoire item. Do not travel to Landro expecting him to sell the pet for ordinary gold without a redeemed code.",
